{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have you ever wondered what it would be like to become a little cat chasing a ball of yarn in a dream?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now you can experience it for yourself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this maddening journey, you control a determined little cat, pushing the yarn all the way up toward the clouds. Sounds simple, right? Wrong. Every step is a struggle, every collision matters, and even the smallest mistake will send the yarn rolling back to the starting point. The only things you can rely on are your paws\u2014left, right, or both together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ll need to traverse semi-realistic, complex paths: squeeze through narrow obstacles, balance on constantly shifting terrain, and struggle in the water, where controlling the cat becomes nearly impossible. Though there are safe zones in each stage, reaching them is a battle of its own.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s unique. It\u2019s punishing. It\u2019s super adorable.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Because this isn\u2019t just another rage game\u2014it\u2019s the world\u2019s first cat-and-yarn rage climb. No matter how many times you fall, you\u2019ll always find yourself saying: \u201cJust one more try.\u201d</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978780?t=1758640406","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978780/a3510cac5976206224939596c7b534db6623d82d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758640406","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978780/2335c2f1942811c9a5ccc5ae131d1db2dd7d910f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758640406","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978780/2335c2f1942811c9a5ccc5ae131d1db2dd7d910f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758640406","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have you ever wondered what it would be like to become a little cat chasing a ball of yarn in a dream?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now you can experience it for yourself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this maddening journey, you control a determined little cat, pushing the yarn all the way up toward the clouds. Sounds simple, right? Wrong. Every step is a struggle, every collision matters, and even the smallest mistake will send the yarn rolling back to the starting point. The only things you can rely on are your paws\u2014left, right, or both together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ll need to traverse semi-realistic, complex paths: squeeze through narrow obstacles, balance on constantly shifting terrain, and struggle in the water, where controlling the cat becomes nearly impossible. Though there are safe zones in each stage, reaching them is a battle of its own.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s unique. It\u2019s punishing. It\u2019s super adorable.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Because this isn\u2019t just another rage game\u2014it\u2019s the world\u2019s first cat-and-yarn rage climb. No matter how many times you fall, you\u2019ll always find yourself saying: \u201cJust one more try.\u201d</strong></p>","developers":["Dosy"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3937150","name":"Cat's Rage"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"2